  "description": "This UiPath library provides an activity that effortlessly sets up and initiates a screen recording application on the target machine. It captures the screen and saves the recorded output to a specified location. By running the recording on a separate thread, it ensures that other processes are not disrupted. This activity is perfect for situations where you want to monitor and record server activity while your bot performs its tasks, without interrupting ongoing operations.",
